home+=f'''<section class="section cream" id="benefits"><div class="section-meta"><span>WHY OURA / START WITH YOUR ROUTINE</span><span>ONE RING. YOUR PRIORITIES.</span></div><h2>Find the Oura Ring 4<br>benefits for <em>your day.</em></h2><div class="need-grid"><article><span class="eyebrow">01 / UNDERSTAND YOUR NIGHTS</span><h3>I want to understand my sleep.</h3><p>Explore estimated sleep stages, timing and consistency, with an example that puts the numbers in context.</p>{a('Explore sleep tracking','sleep.html')}</article><article><span class="eyebrow">02 / BALANCE BUSY DAYS</span><h3>I want a recovery perspective.</h3><p>See how sleep, resting heart rate and HRV trends contribute to a daily readiness view.</p>{a('Explore recovery tracking','readiness.html')}</article><article><span class="eyebrow">03 / EVERYDAY MOVEMENT</span><h3>I want tracking I will keep wearing.</h3><p>Understand screenless activity tracking, everyday comfort and where a smartwatch may complement the ring.</p>{a('Explore daily activity','activity.html')}</article></div></section><section class="section story-split"><img src="assets/ring-poster.svg?v=8" alt="Original illustration of the Oura Ring 4 titanium smart ring in Silver" width="720" height="600" loading="lazy"><div><span class="eyebrow">WHY A RING?</span><h2>A quieter way<br>to wear your data.</h2><p class="large-copy">A screenless ring keeps notifications off your finger. Your insights live in the Oura App, ready when you choose to look.</p><p>Oura Ring 4 is designed for daily wear, with titanium inside and out and recessed sensors. Typical battery life is 5–8 days, depending on size, settings and use.</p>{a('Compare a smart ring and smartwatch','ring.html')}{proof()}</div></section><section class="section cream"><span class="eyebrow">WHY TRUST THE CHOICE?</span><h2>Good questions.<br>Clear answers.</h2><div class="need-grid"><article><h3>Evidence you can inspect.</h3><p>Explore the sensors and the limits of the supporting studies.</p>{a('See the evidence','technology.html')}</article><article><h3>Sizing before guessing.</h3><p>Use the Ring 4 sizing kit. Jewellery sizes and other generations can differ.</p>{a('Find your fit','find-your-ring.html')}</article><article><h3>The full ownership picture.</h3><p>Understand the ring, ongoing membership and the selected Shopee listing.</p>{a('See price and membership guidance','buy.html')}</article></div></section>'''+action('Find your ring.','Choose your finish and size on Shopee. For sizing, membership or feature advice, create a personalised buying guide.')
render('index',home)

comparison='''<div class="comparison-cards"><article><h3>Screen and notifications</h3><dl><dt>Oura Ring 4</dt><dd>Screenless, with insights in the companion app.</dd><dt>Smartwatch</dt><dd>A wrist display, with controls and notifications depending on model.</dd></dl></article><article><h3>Overnight wear</h3><dl><dt>Oura Ring 4</dt><dd>A finger-worn format with a smooth titanium interior.</dd><dt>Smartwatch</dt><dd>A wrist-worn format. Personal comfort and fit matter.</dd></dl></article><article><h3>Workout needs</h3><dl><dt>Oura Ring 4</dt><dd>Daily activity and wellness insights; consider your specific sport.</dd><dt>Smartwatch</dt><dd>Model-dependent workout controls, GPS and on-screen features.</dd></dl></article><article><h3>Ongoing cost</h3><dl><dt>Oura Ring 4</dt><dd>Active membership for detailed insights.</dd><dt>Smartwatch</dt><dd>Subscription and app costs vary by model and service.</dd></dl></article></div>'''
ringbody=mast('THE RING / FIT FOR YOUR ROUTINE','Oura Ring 4 features.<br><em>Ring or smartwatch?</em>','Choose the wearable that fits the way you live, rather than adding another screen by default.')+f'<section class="object-section section">{ring()}<div><h2>Wear it.<br>Keep living.</h2><p class="large-copy">For the nights you want to understand and the days you want to put in perspective.</p><p>The titanium interior and recessed sensors are designed for everyday wear. Explore the fit before deciding what you need.</p>{guide()}</div></section><section class="section cream" id="comparison"><span class="eyebrow">WHY OURA / AN HONEST COMPARISON</span><h2>How Oura Ring 4 fits<br>alongside a smartwatch.</h2><p>A ring may suit you if you value a discreet, screenless format for daily wellness patterns. Keep your watch in the picture if you rely on its workout display, navigation or sport-specific features.</p>'+comparison+'</section><section class="section cream">'+rows([('Choose comfort first','Use the Ring 4 sizing kit before picking a size. A snug, comfortable fit matters for both daily wear and sensing.'),('Know the care guidance','Oura lists water resistance to 100 metres and excludes diving. Follow the official safety and care instructions for your activities.'),('Understand ongoing costs','Detailed insights need an active membership. Compare ring price and membership together before buying.')])+a('Explore Ring 4 sizing','find-your-ring.html')+' '+a('Understand membership and price','buy.html')+'</section>'+action()
render('ring',ringbody,[('Can a ring replace every smartwatch feature?','Choose based on your routine. Oura Ring 4 offers a screenless wellness experience; smartwatch displays, GPS and workout features vary by model.'),('What is Oura Ring 4 made from?',f'The titanium Ring 4 has titanium inside and out with recessed sensors. See the <a href="{SPECS}">official specifications</a>.')])

features={
'sleep':{'focus':'Sleep','kicker':'SLEEP / YOUR NIGHT, EXPLAINED','h1':'Oura Ring 4 sleep tracking.<br><em>Understand your night.</em>','intro':'A late finish at work. A different bedtime. Start noticing the patterns behind your nights, beyond a single score.','h2':'What Oura Ring 4 sleep tracking<br>helps you notice.','img':'sleep-chart.svg','alt':'Illustrative sleep chart showing estimated light, deep and REM sleep stages','example':'Imagine two nights with a similar duration but different bedtimes and interruptions. The useful question is how your patterns change over time, rather than whether one score looks impressive.','rows':[('Estimated stages','Explore light, deep and REM sleep estimates alongside time asleep. A wearable estimate is different from a clinical sleep study.'),('Timing and consistency','Notice how bedtime and wake-time patterns fit the routine you actually have. Use several nights for context.'),('A reason to look closer','Your guide explains sleep features and the membership needed to explore them. It does not diagnose a sleep condition.')],'objection':'Will I learn anything beyond another score?','answer':'Look at the contributors and patterns behind the number. We show one annotated example and link the evidence, so you can decide whether those insights would be useful to you.','link':('Explore sleep-sensing evidence','technology.html')},
'readiness':{'focus':'Recovery','kicker':'RECOVERY / A DAILY PERSPECTIVE','h1':'Oura Ring 4 readiness.<br><em>Recovery in context.</em>','intro':'Your training schedule and your working day share the same body. Explore the signals behind a daily readiness view.','h2':'How Oura Ring 4 readiness<br>puts your trends in context.','img':'readiness-chart.svg','alt':'Illustrative readiness contributors including sleep, resting heart rate and HRV trends','example':'After a busy week, look at sleep and recovery trends together instead of treating a single score as an instruction. Your own baseline and how you feel remain important.','rows':[('Signals, together','Readiness combines contributors including sleep, resting heart rate, heart rate variability and recent activity.'),('A personal baseline','HRV differs between people. Explore trends relative to your own patterns rather than competing on someone else’s number.'),('Context for your choices','The score supports reflection. It is not a medical assessment or a prescription for how hard to train.')],'objection':'I already own a fitness watch. Why add a ring?','answer':'Start with what you want from overnight wear and daily insights. The ring may complement your watch, while the watch can keep the workout display and sport features you rely on.','link':('Compare the ring with your watch','ring.html#comparison')},
'activity':{'focus':'Activity','kicker':'ACTIVITY / EVERYDAY MOVEMENT','h1':'Oura Ring 4 activity tracking.<br><em>Make room for movement.</em>','intro':'Your commute, an evening walk and a busy workday all belong in the picture. Explore a screenless approach to everyday activity.','h2':'How Oura Ring 4 fits<br>your everyday movement.','img':'activity-chart.svg','alt':'Illustrative daily movement chart showing activity across a working day','example':'A walking routine can look different on office days and weekends. Review the pattern over time, then decide which information helps you stay engaged.','rows':[('Everyday activity','Movement sensors help estimate activity. Treat steps and energy measures as estimates, rather than exact performance measurements.'),('Goals with recovery in view','Oura can adapt daily activity goals based on recovery. Detailed feature access depends on active membership.'),('A wearable you choose to wear','Consider comfort, the companion app and the recurring cost. If you need live workout information, compare your watch options too.')],'objection':'Would a simpler fitness band be enough?','answer':'It may be, depending on your priorities. Compare the screenless ring format, overnight comfort and detailed wellness insights with the features and cost of another wearable.','link':('Explore everyday comfort and fit','ring.html')}
}
for slug,d in features.items():
 body=mast(d['kicker'],d['h1'],d['intro'])+f'<section class="section cream story-split"><div><span class="eyebrow">WHY OURA / {d["focus"].upper()}</span><h2>{d["h2"]}</h2><p class="large-copy">{d["example"]}</p><p class="fine">Illustrative example, not an actual customer result.</p>{guide("Get my "+d["focus"].lower()+"-focused buying guide",d['focus'])}</div><img src="assets/{d["img"]}" alt="{d["alt"]}" width="720" height="600" loading="lazy"></section><section class="section cream">'+rows(d['rows'])+f'</section><section class="section objection"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR QUESTION</span><h2>{d["objection"]}</h2><p class="large-copy">{d["answer"]}</p>{a(*d["link"])} {a("See membership and ownership costs","buy.html")}{proof()}</section>'+action('Find the right fit<br>for your routine.',focus=d['focus'])
 render(slug,body,[(f'Do I need membership for detailed {d["focus"].lower()} insights?',f'An active Oura Membership provides detailed insights. See <a href="buy.html">membership and ownership costs</a> before deciding.'),('Where do I buy my selected ring?','Your guide links to the matching Ring 4 finish at OURA SG on Shopee. Confirm your size and the current listing terms there.')])

tech=mast('TECHNOLOGY / EVIDENCE BEFORE HYPE','Oura Ring 4 accuracy.<br><em>Explore the signals.</em>','See what the sensors measure, why fit matters and how to read the supporting research.')+f'<section class="signal-scene technical section grid-bg">{ring()}<h2>How Oura Ring 4 sensors<br>collect your signals.</h2><div class="sensor-controls" aria-label="Sensor explorer"><button type="button" data-sensor="0" aria-pressed="true">01 / Optical sensing</button><button type="button" data-sensor="1" aria-pressed="false">02 / Temperature</button><button type="button" data-sensor="2" aria-pressed="false">03 / Movement</button></div><p id="sensor-copy" class="sensor-copy" aria-live="polite">Optical sensors use light to follow heart rate. Red and infrared light also support overnight blood oxygen sensing.</p><p class="fine">Conceptual illustration; sensor positions are artistic approximations.</p></section><section class="section cream"><span class="eyebrow">WHY TRUST IT / READ THE SOURCE</span><h2>Evidence with context.</h2><div class="evidence-card"><h3>Oura’s reported Smart Sensing comparison</h3><p>Oura describes an August 2024 study with 60 participants comparing Ring 4, Gen3 and reference equipment in a sleep-clinic setting. The reported changes concern specific sensing measures; they are not one accuracy percentage for everything the ring does.</p><p>Source: manufacturer-reported research. Individual results can vary.</p>{a("Read Oura’s study summary",STUDY)}</div>'+rows([('Light and pulse','Green and infrared optical sensing follows heart rate. Other optical measurements support overnight blood oxygen insights.'),('Temperature trends','A digital sensor follows average temperature variations. It does not provide the same reading as a clinical thermometer.'),('Movement and fit','An accelerometer captures movement. The correct size and orientation help the ring collect useful signals.')])+a('Read the source and limitations table','research.html')+'</section>'+action()
render('technology',tech,[('Is there one accuracy percentage for the whole ring?','Accuracy depends on the measure, comparison method and study setting. Read claims with their device generation and limitations.'),('Can Oura Ring 4 diagnose an illness?','Oura supports general wellness insights and is not intended for medical diagnosis. Seek qualified professional advice for health concerns.')])

swatches=''.join(f'<button type="button" aria-label="{n}" title="{n}" data-finish="{n}" data-color="{c}" aria-pressed="{str(i==0).lower()}" style="--swatch:{c}"></button>' for i,(n,c,_) in enumerate(COLORS))
find=mast('SIZING & COLOURS / YOUR PERSONAL CHOICE','Oura Ring 4 sizes & colours.<br><em>Start with your fit.</em>','Explore the finish you like. Use the correct sizing kit before settling on a size.')+f'<section class="config section grid-bg">{ring()}<div class="config-panel"><span class="eyebrow">OURA RING 4 / TITANIUM</span><h2 id="finish-name">Silver</h2><div class="swatches" role="group" aria-label="Choose a Ring 4 finish">{swatches}</div><p>Original colour illustration. Actual finishes can look different in person.</p><label for="ring-size">Your Ring 4 size preference</label><select id="ring-size"><option value="">I don’t know my size yet</option>'+''.join(f'<option value="{n}">{n}</option>' for n in range(4,16))+f'</select><p>Use a Ring 4 sizing kit rather than a standard jewellery size. “Not sure” is a perfectly useful starting point.</p>{guide("Get my sizing and buying guide")}<p class="fine">Your finish and size preference carry into the form.</p></div></section><section class="section cream"><h2>Choose your Oura Ring 4 finish.<br>Then check your fit.</h2>'+rows([('Use the right generation','Ring 4 sizes range from 4–15. Other Oura generations use different sizing guidance; select the Ring 4 kit.'),('Try the sizer through your routine','Follow the official fitting instructions and test the sizer through daily and overnight wear.'),('Review your choice','Your guide brings your preferences together with membership details and the correct OURA SG product link.')])+a('Read official Ring 4 sizing guidance',SPECS)+' '+a('See ownership costs','buy.html')+'</section>'+action()
render('find-your-ring',find,[('Do standard jewellery sizes apply?','Use the Oura Ring 4 sizing kit and official fit guidance instead of relying on a standard jewellery size.'),('Is the Ring 5 sizing kit the same?','Choose the kit for the generation you intend to buy. Oura identifies Ring 4 and Ring 5 sizing kits separately.')])

products=''.join(f'<article class="product-listing"><span class="finish-dot" style="--swatch:{p["color"]}" aria-hidden="true"></span><h3>Oura Ring 4 {p["finish"]}</h3><p>Ring 4 / size selection on Shopee</p>{a("View price & size availability",p["url"])}</article>' for p in RINGS)
buy=mast('PRICE & BUYING / THE FULL PICTURE','Oura Ring 4 price<br><em>in Singapore.</em>','Know what you are choosing, what membership adds and where to check the price for your selected finish.')+f'<section class="section cream"><h2>Understand the total cost<br>of Oura Ring 4 ownership.</h2><div class="cost-grid"><article><span>01 / YOUR RING</span><h3>Ring price</h3><p>Check the current OURA SG listing for your finish and size. Shopee vouchers and availability can change the displayed price.</p></article><article><span>02 / YOUR INSIGHTS</span><h3>Membership</h3><p>Detailed insights require active Oura Membership. Singapore pricing and billing terms should be checked in Oura’s current membership information.</p>{a("Membership details",MEMBER)}</article><article><span>03 / YOUR FIT</span><h3>Sizing & delivery</h3><p>Use the correct sizing kit and check delivery and collection terms. Review any sizing-kit charge and delivery terms on the selected listing.</p></article></div>{guide()}<div class="offer-panel"><span class="eyebrow">WHY TAKE THE NEXT STEP?</span><h3>A personal guide. A clearer decision.</h3><p>Get practical buying guidance now. Our proposed launch campaign is subject to retailer approval.</p>{offer_terms()}</div><h2>Choose a smart ring<br>or keep your smartwatch?</h2>'+comparison+f'<h2>Oura Ring 4 listings<br>at OURA SG on Shopee.</h2><p>Already know your fit? Continue to your selected finish. Check the live price, size availability and item-specific returns or warranty terms before purchasing.</p><div class="product-grid">{products}</div><details class="other-products"><summary>Other products listed by OURA SG</summary><p>These are different-generation products. This website’s guide and main product story focus on Ring 4.</p><ul>'+''.join(f'<li>{a(n,u)}</li>' for n,u in OTHER)+'</ul></details><div class="evidence-card"><h3>Know your buying route.</h3><p>Shopee handles the purchase, payment and order process. Review the selected item’s returns and warranty terms; sizing-kit listings can have different return conditions from rings.</p></div></section>'+action()
render('buy',buy,[('How do I choose and buy my ring?','Create your personalised guide, check your Ring 4 fit and continue to the matching OURA SG listing on Shopee.'),('Is membership included in the ring price?',f'Membership is a separate ongoing consideration. Read <a href="{MEMBER}">Oura’s current membership terms</a>, including eligibility for any included introductory period.'),('What returns or warranty apply?','Review the terms for your selected item on Shopee. Ring and sizing-kit conditions may differ; the kit listing is marked non-returnable and non-refundable.')])

contact=mast('FREE BUYING GUIDE / YOUR PRIORITIES FIRST','Your personalised<br><em>Oura buying guide.</em>','Understand the features that matter to you, find your sizing steps and explore the matching Shopee product.')+f'''<section class="section cream guide-layout"><div class="guide-promise"><span class="eyebrow">WHAT YOU GET</span><h2>A guide to<br>your next step.</h2><ul class="benefit-list"><li>Sleep, recovery or activity: your priorities explained.</li><li>Your selected finish and Ring 4 sizing steps.</li><li>Membership and ownership-cost guidance.</li><li>Your matching OURA SG product on Shopee.</li></ul><div class="guide-preview"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR GUIDE / PREVIEW</span><strong>Your routine.<br>Your ring.</strong><span>01 Features　02 Fit　03 Membership　04 Buying</span></div><div class="offer-panel"><span class="eyebrow">PROPOSED CAMPAIGN / NOT ACTIVE</span><h3>A launch idea.<br>Subject to approval.</h3><p>We propose a S$20 Ring 4 voucher and sizing-kit support. These benefits are not currently redeemable.</p>{offer_terms()}</div></div><div><form id="buying-guide-form"><fieldset><legend>What do you want to track most?</legend><div class="interest-options">{''.join(f'<label><input type="radio" name="interest" value="{n}" required><span>{n}</span></label>' for n in ['Sleep','Recovery','Activity'])}</div></fieldset><label for="guide-name">First name <span>(optional)</span></label><input id="guide-name" name="name" type="text" maxlength="60" autocomplete="given-name"><details class="preferences"><summary>Your ring preferences <span id="preference-summary">Silver · size not sure</span></summary><label for="guide-finish">Ring 4 finish</label><select id="guide-finish" name="finish">{''.join(f'<option>{n}</option>' for n,_,_ in COLORS)}</select><label for="guide-size">Ring 4 size preference</label><select id="guide-size" name="size"><option value="">Not sure — show me the sizing steps</option>{''.join(f'<option value="{n}">{n}</option>' for n in range(4,16))}</select></details><label class="check consent-row"><input id="request-consent" type="checkbox" name="requestConsent" required><span>I consent to the information I provide being processed locally in this browser to generate my personalised buying guide, as explained in the <a href="privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a>.</span></label><label class="check consent-row"><input id="marketing-consent" type="checkbox" name="marketingConsent"><span>I am interested in future product and launch updates. This prototype records my preference only; it does not create a subscription. <strong>Optional.</strong></span></label><p class="field-help">Your guide is available either way. No email address is requested and no mailing-list subscription is created.</p><button class="button" type="submit">Create my free buying guide <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><p id="guide-errors" role="alert"></p><noscript><p>The personalised guide needs JavaScript. You can still read <a href="find-your-ring.html">sizing guidance</a>, <a href="buy.html">ownership costs</a> and the <a href="buy.html#main">product links</a>.</p></noscript></form><section id="guide-result" class="guide-result" hidden tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="guide-result-title"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT STEP / READY</span><h2 id="guide-result-title">Your personalised Oura buying guide is ready.</h2><p id="guide-greeting"></p><p id="guide-summary" class="large-copy"></p><div id="guide-advice"></div><dl id="guide-details"></dl><p id="marketing-status"></p><p id="guide-availability">Confirm your Ring 4 size and current availability on the selected Shopee listing.</p><div class="result-actions"><button id="download-guide" type="button" class="button">Download my guide <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></button><a id="selected-product" class="button" href="{RINGS[0]['url']}" rel="noopener noreferrer">View my selected ring on Shopee <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><button id="reset-guide" type="button" class="text-button">Start again / clear my choices</button></div><p class="field-help">Your guide is ready to read and download below.</p></section></div></section>'''
render('contact',contact,[('What does my buying guide include?','Your selected tracking focus, relevant product benefits, sizing steps, membership guidance, a matching Ring 4 Shopee link and clearly labelled proposed campaign details.'),('Do I have to opt in to marketing?','No. The future-updates preference is optional and does not affect access to your guide.'),('What happens after I create my guide?','Your guide appears on this page and can be downloaded. Continue to the selected Shopee listing when you are ready to check the current product details.')])

privacy=mast('PRIVACY POLICY / A CLEAR VIEW','Privacy Policy for<br><em>buying-guide requests.</em>','How your information and choices are handled. Updated 10 November 2026.')+f'''<section class="section cream prose"><h2>Who to contact</h2><p>Form / Function is this CS2024 project’s name. Alger Goh is the project contact: <a href="mailto:{E(config['privacy_contact'])}">{E(config['privacy_contact'])}</a>. See the <a href="team.html">team page</a> for all members and their roles.</p><h2>What information you provide</h2><p>The form asks what you want to track most (Sleep, Recovery or Activity), an optional first name, ring finish and optional size, required request-processing consent, and an optional preference for future updates. It does not request an email address, phone, address, identity number, payment details or health measurements.</p><h2>Why and how it is processed</h2><p>Your choices generate a personalised guide in this browser tab. No form information is sent to a server, emailed to the team, added to a mailing list or shared with Shopee. We do not use cookies, localStorage or sessionStorage for guide entries. The optional name personalises the displayed guide; you may leave it blank.</p><h2>Separate consent choices</h2><p>The required checkbox covers local processing to create your guide. The separate, unticked optional checkbox records interest in possible future updates for this interaction only. It does not create a real marketing subscription, and leaving it unticked does not affect your guide.</p><h2>Retention and deletion</h2><p>The form resets after guide generation. Your optional name, choices and consent preference remain only in the on-page guide until you select “Start again / clear my choices”, reload or close the tab. This website keeps no submission database. A text guide you choose to download remains on your device until you delete it yourself.</p><h2>Withdraw consent or request help</h2><p>Before creating the guide, untick the optional updates box or clear your entries. Afterwards, select “Start again / clear my choices” to clear the displayed result and consent choice. There is no stored subscription to unsubscribe from. Contact Alger at the email above with questions or requests about this project; do not send health or payment details.</p><h2>Hosting and external links</h2><p>The hosting provider may process normal website request logs under its policies. Clicking a Shopee link takes you to that service, whose privacy and purchase terms apply. Your optional name and consent choices are never included in those links.</p><h2>Before a live enquiry or mailing service</h2><p>Live collection would need a defined operator, justified retention period, secure delivery and storage, access/correction and withdrawal processes, unsubscribe controls and any necessary overseas-transfer arrangements. This version does not operate such a service.</p><p>{a('PDPC’s data-protection guidance','https://www.pdpc.gov.sg/overview-of-pdpa/the-legislation/personal-data-protection-act')}</p></section>'''
render('privacy',privacy,noindex=True)

team=mast('CS2024 / THE PROJECT TEAM','The Oura Ring<br><em>website team.</em>','The people behind this website, its communication and development.')+'<section class="section cream">'+rows([(person['name'],f"{E(person['roles'])}<br><a href=\"mailto:{E(person['email'])}\">{E(person['email'])}</a>") for person in config['team']])+f'<h2>Our agency roles.</h2><p class="large-copy">Alger: project management and web design. Tarence: copywriting and web development. Cheryl: project management and copywriting.</p><p>These overlapping roles were confirmed by the team. Individual task records and contribution evidence are maintained by the team; attendance and completion records are not invented here.</p></section>'
render('team',team,noindex=True)

research=mast('EVIDENCE / SOURCE BY SOURCE','Oura Ring 4 research.<br><em>Evidence you can inspect.</em>','Read the source behind a claim, the generation it concerns and the limits of what it establishes.')+f'''<section class="section cream prose"><h2>How to interpret Oura Ring 4 research</h2><div class="source-list"><article><h3>Product, materials and sizing</h3><p><a href="{SPECS}">Oura Ring 4 support specifications</a>. Manufacturer source for titanium Ring 4, recessed sensors, size range, typical battery life and care limits. Ceramic Ring 4 uses different external material.</p></article><article><h3>Membership and recurring costs</h3><p><a href="{MEMBER}">Oura Membership support</a>. Detailed insights require membership. Pricing varies by region; check Singapore billing terms before purchasing.</p></article><article><h3>Smart Sensing evidence</h3><p><a href="{STUDY}">Oura’s Smart Sensing article</a> describes an August 2024 comparison involving 60 participants. It is manufacturer-reported research comparing Ring 4, Gen3 and reference equipment. The reported measures do not establish one universal accuracy percentage or a guaranteed health outcome.</p></article><article><h3>Singapore audience context</h3><p><a href="https://www.moh.gov.sg/newsroom/national-population-health-survey-2024-shows-singaporeans-are-adopting-healthier-lifestyles---but-rising-obesity-is-a-concern/">MOH’s NPHS 2024 release</a> and <a href="https://www.healthhub.sg/programmes/mindsg/caring-for-ourselves/sleeping-well-adults">HealthHub sleep guidance</a> provide wellness context. They do not prove demand for Oura or willingness to pay.</p></article><article><h3>Selected buying destination</h3><p><a href="https://shopee.sg/ourasg">OURA SG on Shopee</a>. We recovered six Ring 4 finish listings and seven Ring 5 product/kit links. Indexed Silver, Brushed Silver, Stealth, Gold and Rose Gold pages still showed “Sold Out” when rechecked on 10 November 2026; Black could not be fetched. This is indexed evidence, not a live inventory feed. Some Shopee checks require login. Current purchasable Ring 4 stock remains unconfirmed; verify your size and finish before purchasing.</p><p><a href="{KIT4}">Historical Ring 4 sizing-kit listing</a> is separately identified. Do not substitute a Ring 5 kit for a Ring 4 choice.</p></article></div><h2>Availability and the sales plan</h2><p>Marketplace presence does not establish current buyability. Do not start a paid Ring 4 campaign until an orderable size/finish, seller terms and fulfilment are confirmed. <a href="https://support.ouraring.com/hc/en-us/articles/42984195317779-Retail-Purchases">Oura lists Harvey Norman Singapore as a retail partner</a>, which is a separate buying route; we have not verified its current size-specific stock. A retailer page is not a replacement for the assignment’s Shopee/Lazada requirement. Product generation or seller changes need fresh marketplace verification.</p><h2>Original content and design</h2><p>The code, procedural artwork and copy are original. <a href="https://oryzo.ai/">ORYZO by Lusion</a> informed product-centred motion and editorial presentation; its code and media were not reused. Charts and product breakdowns on this site are labelled illustrations.</p><h2>Persona research status</h2><p>The three persona routes represent proposed needs: understanding sleep, interpreting recovery and keeping an everyday activity routine. They have not been validated by interviews. No customer testimonials, expert endorsements or survey results have been invented.</p><h2>SEO and structured data</h2><p>Visible FAQs answer buying questions. Optional FAQPage markup describes those same answers; it is not a promise of a Google rich result. Google <a href="https://developers.google.com/search/updates#removing-faq-rich-result">retired FAQ rich results in 2026</a>.</p><h2>Review date and marketing target</h2><p>Desk research reviewed 10 November 2026. The campaign target remains a 20% relative sales improvement within three calendar months, measured against a comparable seller-confirmed baseline. Guide requests and Shopee clicks are supporting indicators, not proof of sales.</p></section>'''+action()
render('research',research)

